From 31da10abbf370b11410f865674f76a77b4cc4ed7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: C-Fuego <fuego@localhost>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 17:56:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gui): tray-only startup, single-instance guard, safe
 daemon shutdown

- add CLI options: --hidden, -h/--help, -V/--version
- add start_hidden preference persisted in ~/.config/we-layerd/gui.toml
- start without opening the main window when hidden is requested; the
  window can be reopened from the tray menu at any time
- guard against multiple GUI instances via an XDG runtime socket; a
  second launch asks the running instance to show its window
- only stop the we-layerd daemon on exit when this GUI process spawned
  it, leaving independently started daemons untouched
